  "text": "Singapore Tours - Singapore | Prestige Holidays 4U Prestige Holidays 4U Where Great Journey Begins Home Domestic International Packages Customize Trip About Contact +91 63618 77187 International Singapore Singapore Futuristic city-state with Gardens by the Bay and diverse culture Why Visit Singapore? Singapore is a modern marvel where cutting-edge architecture meets lush green spaces. Explore the iconic Marina Bay Sands, wander through the futuristic Gardens by the Bay, and experience diverse cultures in vibrant neighborhoods. From world-class shopping on Orchard Road to sampling hawker center delights, Singapore offers a perfect blend of urban sophistication and natural beauty. Best Time to Visit February to April Top Attractions Gardens by the Bay Marina Bay Sands Previous slide Next slide Gardens by the Bay Marina Bay Sands Sentosa Island Universal Studios Singapore Zoo & Night Safari Chinatown & Little India Activities & Experiences Skyline Views Theme Parks Food Tours Shopping Night Safari River Cruises Plan Your Trip Enquire Now WhatsApp Us Contact Information Phone +91 63618 77187 Email showkath@prestigeholidays4u.com Prestige Holidays 4U Where Great Journey Begins Your trusted partner for domestic and international travel experiences. Creating memorable journeys since years. Quick Links Home Domestic Tours International Tours Tour Packages About Us Contact Us Popular Destinations Goa Kerala Maldives Dubai Switzerland Thailand Contact Info No 638/G, HBR 1st Stage, 2nd Block, HBR Layout, Karnataka, Bengaluru – 560043 +91 63618 77187 showkath@prestigeholidays4u.com © 2026 Prestige Holidays 4U. All rights reserved. Chat with us on WhatsApp"
